  "comment": [
    "What GameGuardian 101.4 looks like. Everything a release decides for",
    "itself is here: where its files are, what its views are called, how many",
    "of something it has. Everything Nexus decides is in the transforms.",
    "",
    "To port Nexus to a new GameGuardian release, copy this file to",
    "gg-<version>.json and correct what changed. A release that renumbered",
    "its views needs no change at all: the ids are resolved by name from the",
    "tree's public.xml at apply time.",
    "",
    "The anchors themselves are matched by STRUCTURE, not by the literal text",
    "that carries GameGuardian's numbers, so a release that renumbers does",
    "not break the patch."
  ],
